	(text "HV5622 inputs need V_IH >= VDD - 2 V. Enables tied to 3V3. DRV_BL pulled down: all tube outputs\noff while the RP2040 is in reset (BL low, POL high). R310: the same while 3V3 is absent.\nReadback: U203 DOUT (DRV12_DOUT) to GP12 (SPI1 RX) through R314 / R315 (user, 2026-11-11)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 142.24 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3e92ff61-ec22-5b90-a493-a67ef46036c4"))
